lk music, crafts, storytelling and easy access to caves, rivers and national forest recreation.</p><p>Downtown music and craft culture can fill an evening; Blanchard Springs Caverns, Syllamo trails and the White River turn the same trip into an outdoor adventure.</p></article><aside class="card"><div class="stat"><b>50 mi</b><span>Syllamo Mountain Bike Trail system</span></div><div class="stat"><b>White River</b><span>trout and warm-water fishing nearby</span></div><div class="stat"><b>1870s</b><span>town roots in the Ozark Mountains</span></div></aside></section><div class="head"><h2>Choose your Mountain View experience</h2></div><section class="tiles"><a class="tile" href="/guides/best-things-to-do-mountain-view"><span class="num">01 · MUSIC</span><h3>Pick on the square</h3><p>Bring a chair, listen to local musicians and experience one of the Ozarks' most distinctive traditions.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/guides/best-caves-in-the-ozarks"><span class="num">02 · CAVES</span><h3>Explore Blanchard</h3><p>Make time for the cavern and surrounding recreation area north of town.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/guides/ozarks-fishing-trips"><span class="num">03 · RIVER</span><h3>Fish the White River</h3><p>Build a fishing day with an outfitter, guide or your own tackle and check current rules.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/guides/bentonville-mountain-biking"><span class="num">04 · BIKE</span><h3>Ride Syllamo</h3><p>Bring a mountain bike for rugged Ozark terrain and a memorable trail day.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/guides/ozarks-cabins-with-hot-tubs"><span class="num">05 · STAY</span><h3>Book a cabin</h3><p>Stay close to the square, river or forest and turn a day trip into a weekend.</p></a><a class="tile" href="/guides/ozarks-weekend-getaway"><span class="num">06 · WEEKEND</span><h3>Build the circuit</h3><p>Connect Mountain View with Buffalo River, Ozark Highlands or another destination hub.</p></a></section><div class="head"><h2>Build the trip</h2></div><section class=